{"id":"glassmorphism","title":"Glassmorphism — Glass UI Kit","description":"Frosted-glass cards floating over animated colour blobs — backdrop blur, soft borders and depth. Suited to futuristic dashboards, media players and tech app UI.","tags":["glassmorphism","ui","blur"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:28:05.381Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Glassmorphism — Glass UI Kit\ndescription: Frosted-glass cards floating over animated colour blobs — backdrop blur, soft borders and depth. Suited to futuristic dashboards, media players and tech app UI.\ntags: [glassmorphism, ui, blur]\norder: 7\n---\n\n# Glassmorphism — Glass UI Kit\n\nThe material is the design: `backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%)` panels at 10–18% white, 1px light borders and large soft shadows, floating over slow-moving colour blobs.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | indigo→violet gradient + 3 blurred blobs (`#22d3ee`, `#f472b6`, `#a3e635`) |\n| Glass | `rgba(255,255,255,0.12)` · border `rgba(255,255,255,0.35)` · blur 20px |\n| Radius | 22px panels, 999px pills |\n| Text | white at 100/70/55% |\n\n## Pieces\n\nNow-playing glass widget (with fake equaliser), 3 glass stat chips, a glass dock of icon buttons, and pointer-tilt on the main card.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Glassmorphism — Glass UI Kit\n\nThe material is the design: `backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%)` panels at 10–18% white, 1px light borders and large soft shadows, floating over slow-moving colour blobs.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Background | indigo→violet gradient + 3 blurred blobs (`#22d3ee`, `#f472b6`, `#a3e635`) |\n| Glass | `rgba(255,255,255,0.12)` · border `rgba(255,255,255,0.35)` · blur 20px |\n| Radius | 22px panels, 999px pills |\n| Text | white at 100/70/55% |\n\n## Pieces\n\nNow-playing glass widget (with fake equaliser), 3 glass stat chips, a glass dock of icon buttons, and pointer-tilt on the main card.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Lumen — Glassmorphism\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; background: linear-gradient(130deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed 55%, #db2777); color: #fff; overflow-x: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 40px 20px; position: relative; }\n  .blob { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(90px); opacity: 0.55; animation: drift 16s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }\n  .b1 { width: 420px; height: 420px; background: #22d3ee; top: -80px; left: -60px; }\n  .b2 { width: 380px; height: 380px; background: #f472b6; bottom: -100px; right: -60px; animation-delay: -5s; }\n  .b3 { width: 300px; height: 300px; background: #a3e635; top: 40%; left: 55%; animation-delay: -10s; }\n  @keyframes drift { to { transform: translate(70px, 40px) scale(1.15); } }\n\n  .stage { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 860px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr; gap: 22px; z-index: 1; }\n  .glass { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); border-radius: 22px; backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(17, 12, 46, 0.35); padding: 26px; }\n  .glass-sm { padding: 18px 20px; }\n\n  .player { transition: transform 0.15s ease; transform-style: preserve-3d; }\n  .cover { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.35), rgba(255,255,255,0.08)); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 44px; }\n  .t { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 16px; }\n  .a { font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.75; }\n  .bar { height: 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); margin: 18px 0 8px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .bar i { display: block; height: 100%; width: 38%; background: #fff; border-radius: 999px; }\n  .times { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.7; }\n  .eq { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 3px; height: 26px; margin-top: 16px; }\n  .eq i { width: 5px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); border-radius: 2px; animation: eq 0.9s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  .eq i:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.15s; } .eq i:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }\n  .eq i:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.45s; } .eq i:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }\n  @keyframes eq { 0%, 100% { height: 8px; } 50% { height: 26px; } }\n\n  .col { display: grid; gap: 22px; align-content: start; }\n  .stat .k { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; opacity: 0.65; }\n  .stat .v { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-top: 4px; }\n  .stat .d { font-size: 12.5px; opacity: 0.7; }\n  .stat .d b { color: #a7f3d0; }\n\n  .dock { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 14px 18px; }\n  .dock button { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #fff; font-size: 17px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }\n  .dock button:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28); transform: translateY(-4px); }\n\n  .chip { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n  .chip .ic { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 18px; flex: none; }\n  .chip .tx { font-size: 13.5px; }\n  .chip .tx small { display: block; opacity: 0.65; font-size: 11.5px; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 780px) { .stage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"blob b1\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"blob b2\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"blob b3\">\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"stage\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"glass player\" id=\"tilt\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cover\">🎧\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"t\">Midnight in Putrajaya\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"a\">Lumen Collective · Synth Sessions, Vol. 2\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bar\">\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"times\">\u003cspan>1:42\u003c/span>\u003cspan>4:35\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"eq\">\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"dock\" style=\"padding:14px 0 0; border:0; background:none; box-shadow:none; backdrop-filter:none;\">\n        \u003cbutton>⏮\u003c/button>\u003cbutton style=\"width:54px;height:54px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\">▶\u003c/button>\u003cbutton>⏭\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"col\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"glass glass-sm stat\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"k\">Listeners now\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"v\">12,408\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"d\">\u003cb>▲ 18%\u003c/b> in the last hour\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"glass glass-sm chip\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ic\">⬇\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tx\">Offline mix ready\u003csmall>38 tracks · 2.1 GB\u003c/small>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"glass glass-sm chip\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ic\">✦\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tx\">Weekly discovery\u003csmall>Refreshes Friday 6pm\u003c/small>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"glass dock\">\n        \u003cbutton>🏠\u003c/button>\u003cbutton>🔍\u003c/button>\u003cbutton>❤️\u003c/button>\u003cbutton>⚙️\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // gentle pointer tilt on the main glass card\n    const card = document.getElementById('tilt');\n    addEventListener('pointermove', e => {\n      const r = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n      const dx = (e.clientX - (r.left + r.width / 2)) / r.width;\n      const dy = (e.clientY - (r.top + r.height / 2)) / r.height;\n      card.style.transform = `rotateY(${dx * 6}deg) rotateX(${-dy * 6}deg)`;\n    });\n    addEventListener('pointerleave', () => card.style.transform = '');\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Lumen — Glassmorphism\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; background: linear-gradient(130deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed 55%, #db2777); color: #fff; overflow-x: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 40px 20px; position: relative; }\n  .blob { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(90px); opacity: 0.55; animation: drift 16s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }\n  .b1 { width: 420px; height: 420px; background: #22d3ee; top: -80px; left: -60px; }\n  .b2 { width: 380px; height: 380px; background: #f472b6; bottom: -100px; right: -60px; animation-delay: -5s; }\n  .b3 { width: 300px; height: 300px; background: #a3e635; top: 40%; left: 55%; animation-delay: -10s; }\n  @keyframes drift { to { transform: translate(70px, 40px) scale(1.15); } }\n\n  .stage { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 860px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr; gap: 22px; z-index: 1; }\n  .glass { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35); border-radius: 22px; backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%); box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(17, 12, 46, 0.35); padding: 26px; }\n  .glass-sm { padding: 18px 20px; }\n\n  .player { transition: transform 0.15s ease; transform-style: preserve-3d; }\n  .cover { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 16px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.35), rgba(255,255,255,0.08)); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 44px; }\n  .t { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 16px; }\n  .a { font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.75; }\n  .bar { height: 4px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); margin: 18px 0 8px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .bar i { display: block; height: 100%; width: 38%; background: #fff; border-radius: 999px; }\n  .times { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 11px; opacity: 0.7; }\n  .eq { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 3px; height: 26px; margin-top: 16px; }\n  .eq i { width: 5px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); border-radius: 2px; animation: eq 0.9s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  .eq i:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.15s; } .eq i:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }\n  .eq i:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.45s; } .eq i:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }\n  @keyframes eq { 0%, 100% { height: 8px; } 50% { height: 26px; } }\n\n  .col { display: grid; gap: 22px; align-content: start; }\n  .stat .k { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em; opacity: 0.65; }\n  .stat .v { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-top: 4px; }\n  .stat .d { font-size: 12.5px; opacity: 0.7; }\n  .stat .d b { color: #a7f3d0; }\n\n  .dock { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 14px 18px; }\n  .dock button { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #fff; font-size: 17px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }\n  .dock button:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28); transform: translateY(-4px); }\n\n  .chip { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n  .chip .ic { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 18px; flex: none; }\n  .chip .tx { font-size: 13.5px; }\n  .chip .tx small { display: block; opacity: 0.65; font-size: 11.5px; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 780px) { .stage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"blob b1\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"blob b2\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"blob b3\">\u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"stage\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"glass player\" id=\"tilt\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"cover\">🎧\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"t\">Midnight in Putrajaya\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"a\">Lumen Collective · Synth Sessions, Vol. 2\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"bar\">\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"times\">\u003cspan>1:42\u003c/span>\u003cspan>4:35\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"eq\">\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003ci>\u003c/i>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"dock\" style=\"padding:14px 0 0; border:0; background:none; box-shadow:none; backdrop-filter:none;\">\n        \u003cbutton>⏮\u003c/button>\u003cbutton style=\"width:54px;height:54px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\">▶\u003c/button>\u003cbutton>⏭\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"col\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"glass glass-sm stat\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"k\">Listeners now\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"v\">12,408\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"d\">\u003cb>▲ 18%\u003c/b> in the last hour\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"glass glass-sm chip\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ic\">⬇\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tx\">Offline mix ready\u003csmall>38 tracks · 2.1 GB\u003c/small>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"glass glass-sm chip\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ic\">✦\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tx\">Weekly discovery\u003csmall>Refreshes Friday 6pm\u003c/small>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"glass dock\">\n        \u003cbutton>🏠\u003c/button>\u003cbutton>🔍\u003c/button>\u003cbutton>❤️\u003c/button>\u003cbutton>⚙️\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // gentle pointer tilt on the main glass card\n    const card = document.getElementById('tilt');\n    addEventListener('pointermove', e => {\n      const r = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n      const dx = (e.clientX - (r.left + r.width / 2)) / r.width;\n      const dy = (e.clientY - (r.top + r.height / 2)) / r.height;\n      card.style.transform = `rotateY(${dx * 6}deg) rotateX(${-dy * 6}deg)`;\n    });\n    addEventListener('pointerleave', () => card.style.transform = '');\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}